: '<a href="https://mobile.twitter.com" rel="nofollow">Twitter Web App</a>', 'note_tweet': {'is_expandable': True, 'note_tweet_results': {'result': {'id': 'Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE4NzkzMDUxNDA2NjgwNzE5MzY=', 'text': 'from the FDA SE approval of Marlboro Blend 27 100\'s:\n\n"The applicant provided the smoke yields of tar, nicotine, and carbon monoxide (TNCO), carbonyls (i.e., formaldehyde, acetaldehyde, acrolein, and crotonaldehyde), volatile organics (i.e., acrylonitrile, isoprene, benzene, 1,3-butadiene and toluene), ammonia, benzo[a]pyrene, N-nitrosonornicotine (NNN), and 4-[methyl(nitroso)amino]-1-(3-pyridinyl)-1-butanone (NNK) for the new and corresponding predicate products for SE0016868. PD1, SE0016964. PD1, SE0016996.PD1 - SE0016999.PD1, and SE0017241.PD1 under ISO and Cl smoking regimens.\n\nThey also provided appropriate method validation information. TOST& analyses of HPHC data indicates that the HPHC data are statistically equivalent or non-equivalent but lower. \n\nTherefore, the differences in characteristics between the new and corresponding predicate products do not cause the new products to raise different questions of public health from a chemistry perspective."\n\nhttps://t.co/SYXFvnV1ni', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [{'display_url': 'fda.gov/media/165403/d…', 'expanded_url': 'https://www.fda.gov/media/165403/download?attachment', 'url': 'https://t.co/SYXFvnV1ni', 'indices': [975, 998]}], 'user_mentions': []}, 'richtext': {'richtext_tags': [{'from_index': 768, 'to_index': 972, 'richtext_types': ['Bold']}]}, 'media': {'inline_media': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 6, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Tue Jan 14 23:10:36 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1879305140882002203', 'display_text_range': [0, 275], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'media': [{'display_url': 'pic.x.com/1H6MV24I0x', 'expanded_url': 'https://x.com/StandWithVape/status/1879305140882002203/photo/1', 'id_str': '1879304837990379520', 'indices': [276, 299], 'm